===Etymology===
Probably an irregular derivation from the same root as {{m|fi|kamala}}<ref>{{R:fi:NSES}}</ref> (for the ''m'' ~ ''mm'' variation, compare {{m|fi|hämmentää}} < {{m|fi|hämätä}}).

